  "meta": {
    "created_by": "zenodex",
    "model_id": "liquity_v1_sp_offset_redistribution_bounded",
    "notes": "Bounded reference projection of Liquity V1\nTroveManager._getOffsetAndRedistributionVals.\n\nGiven positive liquidated debt, post-gas-compensation collateral, and\nStability Pool deposits:\n  debt_to_offset = min(debt, sp_deposits)\n  collateral_to_sp = floor(collateral * debt_to_offset / debt)\n  the remaining debt and collateral are redistributed.\n\nBranches are exhaustive and disjoint:\n  0 = FullRedistribution (SP is empty)\n  1 = PartialOffsetAndRedistribution (0 < SP < debt)\n  2 = FullOffset (SP >= debt)\n\nSource pin:\n  liquity/dev@8f52f2906f99414c0b1c3a84c95c74c319b7a8c6\n  TroveManager._getOffsetAndRedistributionVals\n\nNon-claims:\n  - no liquidation eligibility or target selection;\n  - collateral input already excludes gas compensation;\n  - no per-recipient redistribution accumulator or rounding-error tracker;\n  - no runtime binding to current zUSD's full-SP-only liquidation.\n"
  },
